  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="11">[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="11" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ we lærað swyþe geornlice þæt æghwilc Christen man unriht hæmed georne forbuge ⁊ Christene lage rihtlice healde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And we very earnestly enjoin upon every Christian man carefully to avoid illicit unions and duly to observe the laws of the church.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wir lehren recht ernstlich, dass jeder christliche Mensch willig gesetzwidrigen Beischlaf meide und die geistlichen Rechtsordnungen gesetzlich halte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And we teach very earnestly that every Christian man eagerly avoid unlawful intercourse and keep the Christian law rightly.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
